{
  "about": "「改成不跑」：~/.npmrc 末尾加一行（权限照旧，原来那份进废纸篓）、没有 pip.conf 就新建；下一轮不再报；放回换回原来的、新建的移走",
  "case": "mcp/apply/scripts-off",
  "steps": [
    {
      "exit": 0,
      "run": [
        "luoke-scan",
        "update",
        "--data",
        "$FIXTURE/data",
        "--tool-dir",
        "$FIXTURE/tools",
        "--force"
      ],
      "stdout": [
        "病毒库更新好了（daily 27000）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "exit": 0,
      "json": {
        "findings": [
          {
            "category": "posture",
            "evidence": {
              "append": "ignore-scripts=true",
              "how": "点「关闭自动运行」会在 ~/.npmrc 末尾加一行 ignore-scripts=true；原来那份移到废纸篓，能放回。已装的依赖里 esbuild、fsnative 要跑安装脚本，改了以后装它们要单独放行：npm rebuild esbuild fsnative --ignore-scripts=false。这一行也会让项目自己的 prepare 和 pre、post 脚本不跑（比如 husky 装 git 钩子），要跑时用 npm run <脚本名>。升到 npm 12 以后默认就不跑依赖的安装脚本，也能设新版本晚几天再装（min-release-age）。",
              "packages": "esbuild、fsnative",
              "tool": "npm",
              "used": "~/.npmrc",
              "why": "装着的 npm 11.6.2（$FIXTURE/usr-local/lib/node_modules/npm）默认会跑依赖的安装脚本，~/.npmrc 里没有关掉"
            },
            "key": "npm",
            "path": "~/.npmrc",
            "rule": "pkg.install-scripts",
            "severity": "medium",
            "title": "npm 允许依赖在安装时跑脚本",
            "verdict": "confirm"
          },
          {
            "category": "posture",
            "evidence": {
              "append": "only-binary = :all:",
              "how": "点「关闭自动运行」会新建 ~/.config/pip/pip.conf，写上 only-binary = :all:；放回时把它移走。改了以后，没有现成安装包（wheel）的包会装不上，本地的项目（pip install .）也可能装不上；要装时单独放行：pip install --only-binary :none: <包名>。也可以让新版本晚一天再装：pip 26.1 起在 [global] 加 uploaded-prior-to = P1D。",
              "tool": "pip",
              "used": "~/Library/Caches/pip",
              "why": "pip 在这台 Mac 上从源码编译过 pycrypto，编译时会运行包自带的 setup.py"
            },
            "key": "pip",
            "path": "~/.config/pip/pip.conf",
            "rule": "pkg.install-scripts",
            "severity": "medium",
            "title": "pip 装源码包时会跑它的构建脚本",
            "verdict": "confirm"
          }
        ],
        "finishedAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:00Z",
